## Inspiration & Attribution

This project was heavily inspired by the work of **Yuvi9587** and their
[Kemono Downloader](https://github.com/Yuvi9587/Kemono-Downloader) project.
While this codebase was rewritten entirely from scratch with a different
architecture, UI framework, and heavelly modified feature set, it would not exist without that
original work serving as a foundation and reference point. Credit and sincere
appreciation go to Yuvi9587 for their contribution to the community.

---

## Third-Party Components

This project bundles a pre-compiled copy of **yt-dlp** in the `dependencies/`
folder to assist with downloading embedded streaming media (Vimeo, YouTube,
Streamable, RedGifs, etc.). yt-dlp is an open-source project released into the
public domain under the Unlicense.

- yt-dlp repository: https://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp
